<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Korean Grammar Notes</title>
<style>
    body {
        background-color: #e0e0e0;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 20px;
        font-family: 'Malgun Gothic', 'Apple SD Gothic Neo', sans-serif;
    }
    .page {
        background-color: #fffdf5;
        width: 800px;
        padding: 40px 50px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        color: #222;
        line-height: 1.8;
        font-size: 18px;
    }
    .red {
        color: #b32d37;
    }
    .indent-1 {
        margin-left: 2.5em;
    }
    .indent-2 {
        margin-left: 6em;
    }
    .right-align {
        text-align: right;
        padding-right: 5em;
    }
    .section {
        margin-bottom: 25px;
    }
    .flex-row {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .bracket-container {
        display: flex;
        align-items: stretch;
        margin-top: 10px;
    }
    .bracket {
        border: 2px solid #222;
        border-right: none;
        width: 8px;
        margin-right: 12px;
        margin-top: 8px;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .vocab-block {
        display: flex;
        margin-left: 60px;
        gap: 50px;
    }
    .vocab-col {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
    }
    .bottom-vocab-row {
        display: flex;
        gap: 30px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <!-- Section 1 -->
        <div class="section">
            <div><span class="red">1. A不是B</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span class="red">A은/는 B이/가 아닙니다</span></div>
            <div class="indent-1">(저는) 학생이 아닙니다.</div>
            <div class="indent-2">我不是学生.</div>
            <div class="indent-1" style="margin-top: 5px;">이 사람은 가수가 아닙니다.</div>
            <div class="indent-2">这个人不是歌手.</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 2 -->
        <div class="section">
            <div class="red">2. "ㅢ"的发音规则.</div>
            <div class="indent-1">① 当"ㅢ"位于词首并遇到"ㅇ"时, 发[-ㅣ].</div>
            <div class="right-align">의사, 의자</div>
            <div class="indent-1">② 当"ㅢ"位于词中或遇到其他辅音时, [ㅣ]</div>
            <div class="right-align">수의사, 희망</div>
            <div class="indent-1">③ 当"ㅢ"作为"的"意思时, <span class="red">[에]</span> , 태양의 후예</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 3 -->
        <div class="section flex-row">
            <div>3. A是B的C &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; A은/는 B</div>
            <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; margin: 0 4px;">
                <div style="line-height: 1;">의</div>
                <div style="font-size: 0.8em; line-height: 1; margin-top: 2px;">[에]</div>
            </div>
            <div> C입니다.</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 4 -->
        <div class="section">
            <div>4. A不是B的C &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; A은/는 B의 C이/가 아닙니다.</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 5: Bracket and Vocab -->
        <div class="section flex-row">
            <div class="bracket-container">
                <div class="bracket"></div>
                <div>
                    <div>이것은 무엇입니까?</div>
                    <div>이것은 가방입니다.</div>
                    <div>이것은 가방이 아닙니다.</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="vocab-block">
                <div class="vocab-col">
                    <div>그럼요 当然</div>
                    <div>당연하죠 当然了</div>
                    <div>영어 英文</div>
                    <div>모르겠습니다 不知道</div>
                    <div class="red">제=저의 我的</div>
                </div>
                <div class="vocab-col">
                    <div>친구 朋友</div>
                    <div>우산 雨伞</div>
                    <div>시계 表</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 6: Bottom Vocab -->
        <div class="section" style="margin-top: 40px;">
            <div class="bottom-vocab-row">
                <div>生词: 이것 这个</div>
                <div style="margin-left: 20px;"><span class="red">무엇[뭐]</span> 什么</div>
            </div>

            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto auto auto; gap: 10px 50px; margin-left: 3.5em; margin-bottom: 15px;">
                <div><span class="red">가방</span> 书包</div>
                <div><span class="red">아니요</span> 不是</div>
                <div><span class="red">이/가 아닙니다</span> 不是</div>

                <div><span class="red">그래요</span> 是吗</div>
                <div><span class="red">그럼</span> 那么</div>
                <div><span class="red">한국어</span> 韩语</div>

                <div><span class="red">책</span> 书</div>
                <div style="grid-column: span 2;"><span class="red">알겠습니다</span> 我知道了(알았어)</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bottom-vocab-row" style="gap: 25px;">
                <div>그것 那个</div>
                <div>저것 那个(距离更远)</div>
                <div>핸드백 手提包</div>
                <div>백팩 背包</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
```
